; ---- endpoint-u (dedicated one-way-media sender responder) ----------
; A SECOND deterministic sender AOR for the M4 one-way media proof.
; The mid-call-loss proof uses endpoint-t (RTP src port 12070); the
; one-way proof uses endpoint-u (RTP src port 12120) so each wire
; guard binds to its OWN stream identity (no cross-test RTP can
; satisfy the wrong proof). reject_endpoint.py registers here in
; sender mode.
[endpoint-u]
